text_masked:
I cannot say enough about the friendliness and helpfulness of the staff. The customer service was actually wonderful. The problems, however, were many:
1) initially our keys would not work, that problem was remedied only to have the same problem the following morning when returning from front desk looking for a functioning hair dryer at 6:15 am;
2) from 11 pm to 4 am there must have been some kind of party or get together in the lobby, it was extremely loud and impossible to sleep;
3) the hair dryer in our room would not work, staff was very kind trying to find us one but they were unable, allowed me into a dirty room that someone had just checked out of (6:30 am) to use that hair dryer.
